---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: tartor.html
title: Tårtor
description: "Trettio av världens mest kända tårtor, från prinsesstårta till Sachertorte: hur svåra de är, vad de är byggda av och vad du gör med det som blir över."
back: {path: receptarkiv.html, label: Till receptarkivet}
archivePicker: true
scripts: [tartor.js]
---
{#- The cakes: archive recipes with a `tarta` block (lib/cakes.js), by their number, as cards
    (cake-card.njk), laid out like pastasorter.html: the search, a row of level buttons and one of parts,
    the count with the origin menu on the right (by region: lib/cakes.js), and the cards. Without JavaScript the filter stays
    hidden and the cards are links to the recipes. With it (src/js/tartor.js) the filter narrows the
    cards; a card opens its recipe in the recipe dialog, as in the archive (data-open, app.js).
    The choices are the values the cakes have (cakeChoices in lib/cakes.js). Their field names, niva,
    del and ursprung, are also the query string (tartor.html?del=marsipan) and the cards' data attributes.
    Above the list, a link to the base recipe for each part that has one; below it, archive recipes for
    what the baking leaves over. -#}
{%- from 'cake-card.njk' import cakeCard with context -%}
{%- from 'recipe-card.njk' import recipeCard -%}
{%- set choices = collections.cakes | cakeChoices -%}
{%- set regionIcons = {
  'Australien': 'australia',
  'Asien': 'asia',
  'Europa': 'europe',
  'Sydamerika': 'south-america',
  'USA': 'north-america'
} -%}
{%- set leftovers = collections.recipes | recipesById(cakeLeftovers) -%}
{%- set bases = [] -%}
{%- for entry in cakeBaseRecipes -%}
{%- set found = (collections.recipes | recipesById([entry.id]))[0] -%}
{%- if found %}{% set bases = (bases.push({part: entry.part, label: entry.label, recipe: found}), bases) %}{% endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
  <main id="main" class="wrap archive-page cake-index">
    <section class="greeting archive-greeting" aria-labelledby="cake-index-title">
      <div>
        <a class="text-button archive-back" href="{{ back.path }}"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{ back.label }}</a>
        <h1 id="cake-index-title"><span class="marker">Tårtor.</span></h1>
        <p class="greeting-intro">Här är {{ collections.cakes.length }} av världens mest kända tårtor i sin klassiska form, bakade med dagens tekniker. Kakaon löses i hett kaffe, cheesecaken svalnar i ugnen och grädden stabiliseras med mascarpone i stället för gelatin. Är du ny på tårtor, börja med en som är märkt Nybörjare.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="greeting-aside" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="assets/icons/birthday-cake.svg" alt="" width="160" height="160">
      </div>
    </section>
    {%- for entry in bases %}

    <p class="pasta-homemade cake-base"><img src="assets/icons/{{ cakeParts[entry.part].icon }}.svg" alt="" width="36" height="36"><span>{{ entry.label }} finns i {{ collections.cakes | cakesMadeWith(entry.recipe.fileSlug) | length }} av tårtorna. Börja med grundreceptet: <a href="recept/{{ entry.recipe.fileSlug }}.html" data-open="{{ entry.recipe.fileSlug }}">{{ entry.recipe.data.title }}</a>.</span></p>
    {%- endfor %}

    <section class="recipes-section archive-recipes pasta-list cake-list" aria-labelledby="cake-list-title">
      <h2 id="cake-list-title" class="eyebrow">Hitta en tårta</h2>
      <form id="cake-filter" class="archive-controls cake-controls" role="search" aria-labelledby="cake-list-title" hidden>
        <div class="archive-search">
          <label for="cake-search">Sök på namn, land eller ingrediens</label>
          <div class="archive-search-field">
            <img src="assets/icons/magnifying-glass.svg" alt="" width="23" height="23">
            <input id="cake-search" name="q" type="search" placeholder="T.ex. marsipan, Japan eller kaffe" autocomplete="off">
          </div>
        </div>
        <details class="archive-filter-panel">
          <summary>
            <img src="assets/icons/filter-funnel.svg" alt="" width="18" height="18">
            <span>Filter</span>
            <span class="archive-filter-count" hidden>0</span>
            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </summary>
          <div class="archive-filter-panel-body">
            <div class="archive-filters">
              <p class="filter-label" id="cake-niva-label">Nivå</p>
              <div class="archive-quick-filters" role="group" aria-labelledby="cake-niva-label">
                {%- for level in choices.levels %}
                <button class="food-filter" type="button" data-niva="{{ level }}" aria-pressed="false"><img src="assets/icons/{{ cakeLevels[level] }}.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22">{{ level }}</button>
                {%- endfor %}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="archive-filters">
              <p class="filter-label" id="cake-del-label">Byggd med</p>
              <div class="archive-quick-filters" role="group" aria-labelledby="cake-del-label">
                {%- for part in choices.parts %}
                <button class="food-filter" type="button" data-del="{{ part }}" aria-pressed="false"><img src="assets/icons/{{ cakeParts[part].icon }}.svg" alt="" width="22" height="22">{{ cakeParts[part].label }}</button>
                {%- endfor %}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
      </form>
      <div class="archive-results-row">
        <div class="cake-results">
          <p id="cake-count" class="meta archive-results" role="status">{{ collections.cakes.length }} tårtor</p>
          <button id="cake-reset" class="text-button pasta-reset" type="button" data-cake-clear hidden>Rensa filtren</button>
        </div>
        <div id="cake-origin-field" class="archive-sort" hidden>
          <span class="sr-only" id="cake-origin-label">Ursprung</span>
          <details id="cake-origin" class="meal-picker">
            <summary aria-labelledby="cake-origin-label cake-origin-value">
              <img src="assets/icons/globe.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24">
              <span id="cake-origin-value">Hela världen</span>
              <i class="fas fa-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </summary>
            <div class="meal-picker-options" role="group" aria-labelledby="cake-origin-label">
              <button type="button" tabindex="-1" data-value="" aria-pressed="true"><img src="assets/icons/globe.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24"><span>Hela världen</span><img src="assets/icons/check-mark.svg" alt="" width="16" height="16"></button>
              {%- for region in choices.regions %}
              <button type="button" tabindex="-1" data-value="{{ region }}" aria-pressed="false"><img src="assets/icons/{{ regionIcons[region] or 'globe' }}.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24"><span>{{ region }}</span><img src="assets/icons/check-mark.svg" alt="" width="16" height="16"></button>
              {%- endfor %}
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="cake-grid" class="recipe-grid" data-load-more="tårtor">
        {%- for item in collections.cakes %}
        {{ cakeCard(item, '') }}
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      <div id="cake-empty" class="empty-saved" hidden>
        <img src="assets/icons/book-search.svg" width="52" height="52" alt="">
        <h3>Inga träffar.</h3>
        <p>Ingen tårta passar alla valen. Prova en annan kombination.</p>
        <button class="text-button" type="button" data-cake-clear>Rensa filtren</button>
      </div>
    </section>
    {%- if leftovers.length %}

    <section class="recipes-section archive-recipes cake-leftovers" aria-labelledby="cake-leftovers-title">
      <h2 id="cake-leftovers-title" class="eyebrow">Rester i finkläder</h2>
      <p class="cake-leftovers-intro">Tårtbak lämnar ofta något efter sig: äggulor, äggvitor eller en sista bit. Under Dekoration och servering står vilken tårta det passar till, och de här recepten i arkivet är gjorda för just sådana rester.</p>
      <div class="recipe-grid" data-load-more="recept">
        {%- for item in leftovers %}
        {{ recipeCard(item.data.recipe.card, '') }}
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
    {%- endif %}
  </main>
